1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,700
THE TEXT CAME AT TWO FOURTEEN A.M.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:06,700
IT WAS FROM NO NAME.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,700
THEN THE PHONE BUZZED AGAIN.

4
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,700
STAY INDOORS. DO NOT ANSWER.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,700
HER APARTMENT IS ON FLOOR NINE.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,700
THE STAIRS ARE THE ONLY WAY DOWN.

7
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,700
RULE NUMBER ONE. DON'T ANSWER UNKNOWN CALLS.

8
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:29,700
IT'S HER MOTHER'S VOICE.

9
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,700
RULE NUMBER TWO. COUNT THE STAIRS.

10
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:38,700
COUNT EVERY STEP.

11
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:43,700
THERE'S ONE MORE STEP THAN THERE SHOULD BE.

12
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,700
RULE NUMBER THREE. PORCH LIGHT OFF.

13
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:52,700
THE LOBBY LIGHT IS ON. DON'T GO TOWARD IT.

14
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:57,700
SOMEONE IS ALREADY IN THE DOORWAY.

15
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,700
RULE NUMBER FOUR. NEVER SAY YES TO THE DOOR.

16
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:06,700
IT ASKS, "CAN I COME IN?"

17
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:11,700
IT SAYS HER NAME RIGHT. IT SAYS IT WRONG.

18
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:16,700
DO YOU OPEN IT?
